// The lock curve as it stood before ticket 20 resolved it: cost growing x4.00
// per ten floors against income's x2.478, so lock cost outran income by x1.614
// per lock and compounded. Kept so the failure it produced stays reproducible —
// the lock line falls permanently behind the wall, climbers trail it by ~82
// floors, and the per-type ceiling ends up setting the crowd size in violation
// of ADR 0011.
(lock_cost0: 500.0, lock_cost_base: 4.0)
